{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50872","headline":"省题诗二十一首 风中琴 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 风中琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虚檐来晓吹，横榻有瑶琴。\n暗报青苹叶，潜生绿绮音。\n数声随籁去，余响人堂深。\n徽假大王按，弦因少女吟。\n如筝飘阁上，似瑟鼓江浔。\n若与钟期会，还知天地心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50872.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50872","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}